{"4234210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gido Gido: Kaiju Battle Party", "steam_appid": 4234210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/0269f1b2a0794edb895c75801391b00b.avif?t=1787898701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras_big/0269f1b2a0794edb895c75801391b00b.webp?t=1787898701 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic 4v4 party brawl is about to go down!</strong> Play as massive, cuddly but combative creatures in a cozy city you can smash to pieces. Then fuse with your squad into an even bigger kaiju you control together for maximum mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gido Gido</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer party game</strong> where adorable kaiju called Gido clash for territory by toppling enemy bases while leveling a bustling, fully destructible city. Each Gido has unique powers, from shooting fireballs and creating goo pools to stunning opponents, and the game’s signature twist lets players <strong>fuse with teammates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy party game chaos in games like <i>Mario Party</i>, <i>Fall Guys</i>, <i>Among Us</i>, or <i>Party Animals</i>, you’ll love teaming up and fusing with friends for epic squad battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique kaiju called Gido</strong> with quirky, distinct powers for each player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/14d014d05419708db55a2882bc417978.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/14d014d05419708db55a2882bc417978.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/14d014d05419708db55a2882bc417978.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative merge mechanic:</strong> Fuse your Gido with friends into larger, more powerful forms that you control together, unlocking new abilities through different combinations and the ability to shoot a devastating blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/9880a038253b3430bb8c29e95c091aed.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/9880a038253b3430bb8c29e95c091aed.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/9880a038253b3430bb8c29e95c091aed.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4v4 kaiju battles</strong> full of chaotic, team-based multiplayer fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/f5153b5360a637000b93917c6f040adb.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/f5153b5360a637000b93917c6f040adb.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/f5153b5360a637000b93917c6f040adb.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, bustling city</strong> with fully destructible environments for epic, over-the-top building devastation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick to learn</strong> <strong>with short matches,</strong> making it perfect for party game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing development </strong>with new Gido, abilities, maps, levels, and gameplay modes planned.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/bc9ce7dcca24850161fd013c0d18cf9b.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/bc9ce7dcca24850161fd013c0d18cf9b.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/bc9ce7dcca24850161fd013c0d18cf9b.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/0269f1b2a0794edb895c75801391b00b.avif?t=1787898701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras_big/0269f1b2a0794edb895c75801391b00b.webp?t=1787898701 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic 4v4 party brawl is about to go down!</strong> Play as massive, cuddly but combative creatures in a cozy city you can smash to pieces. Then fuse with your squad into an even bigger kaiju you control together for maximum mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gido Gido</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer party game</strong> where adorable kaiju called Gido clash for territory by toppling enemy bases while leveling a bustling, fully destructible city. Each Gido has unique powers, from shooting fireballs and creating goo pools to stunning opponents, and the game’s signature twist lets players <strong>fuse with teammates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy party game chaos in games like <i>Mario Party</i>, <i>Fall Guys</i>, <i>Among Us</i>, or <i>Party Animals</i>, you’ll love teaming up and fusing with friends for epic squad battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique kaiju called Gido</strong> with quirky, distinct powers for each player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/14d014d05419708db55a2882bc417978.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/14d014d05419708db55a2882bc417978.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/14d014d05419708db55a2882bc417978.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative merge mechanic:</strong> Fuse your Gido with friends into larger, more powerful forms that you control together, unlocking new abilities through different combinations and the ability to shoot a devastating blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/9880a038253b3430bb8c29e95c091aed.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/9880a038253b3430bb8c29e95c091aed.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/9880a038253b3430bb8c29e95c091aed.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4v4 kaiju battles</strong> full of chaotic, team-based multiplayer fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/f5153b5360a637000b93917c6f040adb.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/f5153b5360a637000b93917c6f040adb.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/f5153b5360a637000b93917c6f040adb.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, bustling city</strong> with fully destructible environments for epic, over-the-top building devastation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick to learn</strong> <strong>with short matches,</strong> making it perfect for party game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing development </strong>with new Gido, abilities, maps, levels, and gameplay modes planned.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/bc9ce7dcca24850161fd013c0d18cf9b.poster.avif?t=1787898701\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/bc9ce7dcca24850161fd013c0d18cf9b.webm?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/extras/bc9ce7dcca24850161fd013c0d18cf9b.mp4?t=1787898701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fuse with your friends into one giant kaiju you all control at once. Together, you're unstoppable! Pick a monster with its own special attack, then stomp through a fully destructible city and clash with rival kaiju in 4v4 party battles. Game nights are back!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/77e9f7fd6a592884e811950e61ba1f58e41d1aa1/header.jpg?t=1787898701", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/bc64be22fe65ce58fda9e75243d697e126cb3583/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787898701", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234210/bc64be22fe65ce58fda9e75243d697e126cb3583/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787898701", "website": "http://gidogido.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 (2GB) / AMD Radeon R9 380 (2GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Proce